    <string name="settings_section_readme">Notes</string>
    <string name="settings_readme">This app is an unofficial client made by a student. It is not affiliated with the Xihua University Library or Jiangsu Huiwen Software, and its data is for reference only — please refer to the library\'s official system.\nAll holdings, loan, and library card data comes from the university library\'s Online Public Access Catalogue (OPAC). This app runs no servers of its own and does not save or upload personal information to any server.\nThe library server is accessible only from within the campus network, so you must connect to the campus network or the university VPN while using the app.\nYour account, password, and sign-in credentials are stored encrypted on this device only, and you can sign out or delete them in Settings at any time.</string>
